    {
      "id": "d3e674f7-5876-4cba-a7fc-0288115d685b",
      "name": "Note: WF-04b · Book a vendor bill in Odoo (shared)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## WF-04b · Book a vendor bill in Odoo (shared)\nCalled with `{ documentId, post, approvedBy }` by\n- **WF-04** after a clean automatic extraction (`post: true`), and\n- **WF-09** when a person approves a document from the review queue (`post: false` → draft for the accountant).\n\nEverything comes from the `documents` row (extracted fields + original PDF), so both callers book identically.\nSteps: find vendor by **VAT ID** (else exact name) or create it → bill with German input taxes (**19 % I / 7 % I**)\n→ attach the PDF → compare **Odoo's computed total** with the invoice → post (or leave as draft).\n\nReturns `{ status: booked | draft | mismatch, billId, billName, reason }`.",
        "width": 1500,
        "height": 360,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "When Called",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      },
      "id": "23eecc25-a80b-44a3-a30c-46847cfd9acb"
    },
    {
      "name": "Load Document",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.postgres",
      "typeVersion": 2.6,
      "position": [
        220,
        200
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 3000,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "executeQuery",
        "query": "SELECT id, supplier_name, supplier_vat_id, invoice_number,\n       to_char(invoice_date, 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS invoice_date, to_char(due_date, 'YYYY-MM-DD') AS due_date,\n       total_amount::float AS total_amount, line_items, confidence::float AS confidence,\n       file_name, file_base64, extraction_raw->>'supplier_address' AS supplier_address\nFROM documents WHERE id = $1;",
        "options": {
          "queryReplacement": "={{ [ $json.documentId ] }}"
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "postgres": {
          "id": null,
          "name": "Postgres – Automation"
        }
      },
      "id": "7620a075-6e17-4126-a40d-cc14ddd1445d"
    },
